 "_gs": "provisional (balancing): GS cap of any item. Refining GS: chance_sucesso_gs % to go up, otherwise it goes down; goes up by 1 to 'max' and down by 1 to −'min', 1 more likely than 2 and so on (linear weight), always within the crafting range. The cap depends on how far the GS is above the range minimum (passo_gs: 'ate' = maximum difference, no 'ate' = the rest)",
