 "_mercado": "maintainer 2026-10-14: very limited market. No fees. Up to max_ordens open orders per character (buy and sell combined). Only these go to the market: crafted gear (weapon, shield, armor, jewelry, tool with quality), items matching padroes (cut gems, finished runeglass) and the final refined items with a daily limit (Asmodeum, Phoenixweave, Runic Leather, Glittering Ebony). Raw materials and intermediate refined items do not; bound items do not.",
 "mercado": {
  "max_ordens": 50,
  "padroes": ["CutT[0-9]+$", "^Runeglass_Gem_"],
  "itens": ["IngotT51", "ClothT51", "LeatherT51", "TimberT51"]
 },
